comments[10]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T11:50:14.103Z",codex-sol,"Oriented real tracker and CI; no open Dependabot PRs or security alerts. Refresh CLI/SDK, pm-ops and pm-changelog exact published pins; preserve peer floor and PM_RELEASE_APPROVED release job guard. The only shipped command is offline ado validate; dogfood must not claim live Azure sync/import/export acceptance. Inspect ignored statement threshold and record its honest measured scope."
  "2026-10-04T11:52:54.738Z",codex-sol,"Test-first canonical launcher refresh: real invalid NODE_PATH file fixture fails old launcher (ENOTDIR replaces original MODULE_NOT_FOUND), then installed pm-ops 2026.10.4 template copied byte-for-byte makes launcher suite pass 8/8. No template edits or new skips. Independent statement threshold is declared but not consumed by the Node V8 gate; record a quality follow-up and report three measured dimensions honestly."
  "2026-10-04T11:57:56.517Z",codex-sol,"Local CI gates, clean audits, packed offline npm/Bun validation and strict health pass; statement enforcement remains a known pre-existing gap in pm-ado-5w3m. Evidence committed with code; release remains owner gated and no Azure writes or publishing. Releasing claim for orchestrator without closing; review final pushed head separately."
  "2026-10-04T12:10:51.436Z",codex-sol,"Review round 1: generated installed pm-github distribution is clone-local and excluded from Git to keep consumer review focused on authored changes. Exact local managed install and zero-case dry-run command/receipt remain in certification docs. Owner publishing gate and statement-coverage follow-up remain unchanged. Initial Node 22/26 CI passed; final-head CI and substantive review receipts remain separate."
  "2026-10-15T17:57:20.117Z",codex-agent,"The 2026.10.4 certification target is obsolete: the current main package pins PM CLI/SDK 2026.10.12 and includes merged PR #25. New command acceptance is tracked separately under the sync epic; this item remains open as requested."
  "2026-10-17T09:26:33.413Z",codex-agent,"Investigating the pm-toolchain Dependabot failure against current main and the last green CI job. Reusing this dependency certification item. Will retain dependency ownership with Dependabot, reproduce the exact dependency and generated-template diff in a scratch worktree, add behavioral regression evidence, and verify npm and Bun release checks with isolated Git identity."
  "2026-10-17T09:29:26.267Z",codex-agent,"Shared root cause with pm-beads#144: Dependabot refreshes the canonical prepare template for pm-ops 2026.10.12, adding pack/publish branches at line 28. Install-only tests leave the notice and both artifact conditions unexecuted (launcher 98.65% lines, 75% branches). Add lifecycle behavior tests on real configured Git checkouts, compatible with both template generations; retain byte equality and all broken-install refusal tests. Pins and thresholds unchanged."
  "2026-10-17T09:40:08.235Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof: the exact Dependabot #30 dependency and generated-template diff on current main reproduced 179 passing tests but 99.96% lines and 99.87% branches overall. LCOV identifies prepare-merge-driver.ts line 28 and BRDA line 27 as uncovered. Keeping both new artifact tests and reverting only the prepare helper lifecycle environment injection reproduces 98.65% launcher lines and 75% branches (exit 1). Restoring that helper starts full npm and Bun release validation. Current-pin focused tests passed 10/10, including a successful pm-linked retry with a 900-second timeout after the default 120-second limit expired under host load."
  "2026-10-17T09:48:43.531Z",codex-agent,"The shared host reached process timeouts during full local validation. Focused behavioral revert evidence is complete; full fix-plus-Dependabot dependency validation is moving to a temporary read-only GitHub Actions validation branch running npm run release:check and bun run release:check with isolated Git identity. The temporary workflow and dependency overlay will remain outside the fix PR."
  "2026-10-17T09:54:51.427Z",codex-agent,"Complete fix-plus-Dependabot validation passed both env HOME=$(mktemp -d) GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check and the equivalent bun run release:check. Each passed 181/181 tests with zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos and 100-percent configured coverage. Proof: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/actions/runs/39022613591 . Behavioral revert evidence and shared launcher root cause are recorded in docs/dependabot-root-cause.md. Pins and thresholds remain unchanged. Implementation is ready for PR CI; releasing the claim without closing the item."
